{"game":"Plants Vs Zombies Fusion","source":"custom","apworld":"pvzf.apworld","world_version":"1.8.1","groups":[{"name":"Game Options","collapsed":false,"options":[{"key":"progression_balancing","name":"Progression Balancing","kind":"named_range","doc":"A system that can move progression earlier, to try and prevent the player from getting stuck and bored early.\n\nA lower setting means more getting stuck. A higher setting means less getting stuck.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>A system that can move progression earlier, to try and prevent the player from getting stuck and bored early.</p>\n<p>A lower setting means more getting stuck. A higher setting means less getting stuck.</p>\n","min":0,"max":99,"default":50,"special":{"disabled":0,"normal":50,"extreme":99},"doc_fr":"Un système qui peut déplacer la progression plus tôt, pour essayer et empêcher le joueur de se coincer et s'ennuyer tôt.\n\nUn réglage plus bas signifie qu'il reste coincé. Un réglage plus élevé signifie moins se coincer.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Un système qui peut déplacer la progression plus tôt, pour essayer et empêcher le joueur de se coincer et s'ennuyer tôt.</p>\n<p>Un réglage plus bas signifie qu'il reste coincé. Un réglage plus élevé signifie moins se coincer.</p>\n"},{"key":"accessibility","name":"Accessibility","kind":"choice","doc":"Set rules for reachability of your items/locations.\n\n**Full:** ensure everything can be reached and acquired.\n\n**Minimal:** ensure what is needed to reach your goal can be acquired.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Set rules for reachability of your items/locations.</p>\n<p><strong>Full:</strong> ensure everything can be reached and acquired.</p>\n<p><strong>Minimal:</strong> ensure what is needed to reach your goal can be acquired.</p>\n","choices":[{"value":"full","label":"Full","id":0},{"value":"minimal","label":"Minimal","id":2}],"aliases":{"items":"full","locations":"full","none":"minimal"},"default":"full","doc_fr":"Définir les règles d'accessibilité de vos objets/emplacements.\n\n**Full:** s'assurer que tout peut être atteint et acquis.\n\n**Minimal:** s'assurer que ce qui est nécessaire pour atteindre votre objectif peut être acquis.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Définir les règles d'accessibilité de vos objets/emplacements.</p>\n<p><strong>Full:</strong> s'assurer que tout peut être atteint et acquis.</p>\n<p><strong>Minimal:</strong> s'assurer que ce qui est nécessaire pour atteindre votre objectif peut être acquis.</p>\n"},{"key":"goal_type","name":"Victory Condition","kind":"choice","doc":"Set goal for victory\nZomboss - complete the Dr. Zomboss' Revenge mini-game (unlocks in the minigames tab with roof)\nAll X-9s - Complete every main area's 9th level\nOdyssey Adventure - Odyssey Adventure: Dragonbreath Torcher\nTrophy Hunt - Collect a percentage of trophies","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"zomboss","label":"Zomboss","id":0},{"value":"all_x9s","label":"All X9S","id":1},{"value":"odyssey_adventure","label":"Odyssey Adventure","id":2},{"value":"trophy_hunt","label":"Trophy Hunt","id":3}],"aliases":{},"default":"zomboss","doc_fr":"Objectif pour la victoire\nZomboss - compléter le mini-jeu du Dr Zomboss' Revenge (déverrouiller dans l'onglet mini-jeux avec toit)\nTous les X-9 - Remplissez le 9ème niveau de chaque zone principale\nAventure Odyssey - Aventure Odyssey: Torcher Dragonbreath\nChasse aux trophées - Recueillir un pourcentage de trophées"},{"key":"trophy_number","name":"Trophy number","kind":"range","doc":"Number of trophies to be included for trophy hunt","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":1,"max":100,"default":10,"doc_fr":"Nombre de trophées à inclure pour la chasse aux trophées"},{"key":"trophy_percentage","name":"Trophy percentage","kind":"range","doc":"PERCENTAGE of trophies required to goal for trophy hunt","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":1,"max":100,"default":50,"doc_fr":"POURCENTAGE des trophées nécessaires pour viser la chasse aux trophées"},{"key":"adventure_extra","name":"Enable Adventure Extra","kind":"choice","doc":"Include the Snow levels/plants as items/locations\nshuffle plants - includes the snow plants but not the levels","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"off","label":"Off","id":0},{"value":"shuffle_plants","label":"Shuffle Plants","id":1},{"value":"on","label":"On","id":2}],"aliases":{"false":"off","true":"on"},"default":"on","doc_fr":"Inclure les niveaux/plantes de neige en tant qu'éléments/emplacements des usines de shuffle - comprend les usines de neige mais pas les niveaux"},{"key":"challenge_sanity","name":"Enable Fusion Challenges","kind":"toggle","doc":"Adds the 12 fusion challenge levels as an item/locations","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"false","doc_fr":"Ajoute les 12 niveaux de défis de fusion en tant qu'élément/emplacements"},{"key":"minigame_sanity","name":"Enable Mini-games","kind":"choice","doc":"Short: Adds 29 shorter 2-flag Minigames as items/locations\nAll: Adds all 61 normal mini-games as items/locations","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"off","label":"Off","id":0},{"value":"short","label":"Short","id":1},{"value":"all","label":"All","id":2}],"aliases":{"false":"off"},"default":"off","doc_fr":"Short: Ajoute 29 mini-jeux plus courts comme éléments/emplacements\nAll: Ajoute les 61 mini-jeux normaux comme éléments/emplacements"},{"key":"vasebreaker_sanity","name":"Enable Vasebreaker","kind":"toggle","doc":"Adds the 6 vasebreaker levels as an item/locations","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"false","doc_fr":"Ajoute les 6 niveaux de vasebreaker en tant qu'élément/emplacements"},{"key":"survival_sanity","name":"Enable Survival Mode","kind":"toggle","doc":"Adds the 10 survival mode levels as items/locations","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"false","doc_fr":"Ajoute les 10 niveaux du mode de survie comme éléments/emplacements"},{"key":"adventure_odyssey","name":"Enable Adventure Odyssey","kind":"toggle","doc":"Adds the 15 Odyssey Adventure levels into the pool as items/locations","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"false","doc_fr":"Ajoute les 15 niveaux Odyssey Adventure dans la piscine en tant qu'éléments/emplacements"},{"key":"odyssey_minigames","name":"Enable Odyssey Mini-games","kind":"choice","doc":"Short - Adds the 14 Odyssey mini-games that are less than 10-flags as items/locations\nAll - Adds all 40 Odyssey mini-games as items/locations","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"off","label":"Off","id":0},{"value":"short","label":"Short","id":1},{"value":"all","label":"All","id":2}],"aliases":{"false":"off"},"default":"off","doc_fr":"Court - Ajoute les 14 mini-jeux Odyssey qui sont moins de 10-flags comme éléments/emplacements Tous - Ajoute les 40 mini-jeux Odyssey comme éléments/emplacements"},{"key":"fusionsanity","name":"Fusionsanity","kind":"counter","doc":"Adds creating each unique fusion as a check\n(Toggle these individually)\nCommon - All basic common fusions\nCommon+ - Common fusions that require more than 2 plants / metal objects.\nAdvanced - Advanced Fusions","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"default":{"Common":0,"Common+":0,"Advanced":0},"valid_keys":[],"min":null,"max":null,"doc_fr":"Ajoute la création de chaque fusion unique comme un contrôle (Toggle ces individuellement)\nCommun - Toutes les fusions communes de base\nCommon+ - Fusions communes qui nécessitent plus de 2 plantes / objets métalliques.\nAvancé - Fusions avancées"},{"key":"randomize_seed_slots","name":"Randomize Seed Slots","kind":"toggle","doc":"Randomize seed slots","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"true","doc_fr":"Randomiser les fentes de semences"},{"key":"randomizer_mowers","name":"Randomize Lawnmowers","kind":"toggle","doc":"Randomize lawnmowers/pool cleaners","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"false","doc_fr":"Randomiser les tondeuses à gazon/nettoyeurs de piscine"},{"key":"trap_percentage","name":"Trap Percentage","kind":"range","doc":"Percentage of filler items to replace with traps","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":0,"max":100,"default":30,"doc_fr":"Pourcentage d'articles de remplissage à remplacer par des pièges"},{"key":"logic_difficulty","name":"Logic Difficulty","kind":"choice","doc":"Logic difficulty\nsimple - lily pad required for pool, flower pot required for roof, mushrooms required for night etc.\nnormal - pool/roof/snow in logic with the right attackers to deal with everything\nhard - may require tedious/ unreliable/ obscure strategies to beat levels","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"simple","label":"Simple","id":0},{"value":"normal","label":"Normal","id":1}],"aliases":{},"default":"normal","doc_fr":"Difficulté logique simple - lit de lis nécessaire pour piscine, pot de fleurs nécessaire pour le toit, champignons nécessaires pour la nuit, etc.\nnormal - pool/roof/neige dans la logique avec les agresseurs bons pour faire face à tout dur - peut exiger des stratégies fastidieuses/ peu fiables/ obscures pour battre les niveaux"},{"key":"filler_weights","name":"Filler Weights","kind":"counter","doc":"Determines the ratio of each filler item","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"default":{"Bonus Sun":16,"Zen Garden Plant":8,"Diamond":4,"Star Meteor":10,"Free Sunflowers":10,"Refreshed Cooldowns":10,"Ice-shroom Assist":10},"valid_keys":[],"min":null,"max":null,"doc_fr":"Détermine le rapport de chaque élément de remplissage"},{"key":"trap_weights","name":"Trap Weights","kind":"counter","doc":"Determines the ratio of each trap","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"default":{"10x Game Speed":10,"Rough Economy":10,"The Fog is Coming":10,"Zombie Meteor":10,"Destroy Everything":0,"Grave Danger":10,"Mystery Box Ambush":10,"Extra Flag":10,"Literature Trap":10},"valid_keys":[],"min":null,"max":null,"doc_fr":"Détermine le rapport de chaque piège"},{"key":"ring_link","name":"Ring Link","kind":"choice","doc":"Enable Ringlink (share Sun with other games' currency)\nNormal - Sun resets locally between levels","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"off","label":"Off","id":0},{"value":"normal","label":"Normal","id":1}],"aliases":{"false":"off"},"default":"off","doc_fr":"Activer Ringlink (Partagez Sun avec la monnaie d'autres jeux)\nNormal - Soleil se réinitialise localement entre les niveaux"},{"key":"negative_sun","name":"Allow Negative Sun From Ring Link","kind":"toggle","doc":"Allow sun to go negative from ringlink\n'Why do I have negative 50 thousand sun?' ","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"false","doc_fr":"Permettre au soleil d'aller négativement à partir de l'anneau\nPourquoi ai-je moins de 50 mille soleils ?"},{"key":"death_link","name":"Death Link","kind":"toggle","doc":"When you die, everyone who enabled death link dies. Of course, the reverse is true too.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>When you die, everyone who enabled death link dies. Of course, the reverse is true too.</p>\n","default":"false","doc_fr":"Quand vous mourez, tous ceux qui ont permis la mort meurent. Bien sûr, l'inverse est vrai aussi.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Quand vous mourez, tous ceux qui ont permis la mort meurent. Bien sûr, l'inverse est vrai aussi.</p>\n"},{"key":"unique_preset","name":"unique_preset","kind":"choice","doc":"On - all unique plants are in the pool (these tend to be very overpowered so use at your own risk)\nExclude Overpowered - removes unique plants that are considered overpowered\nAdventure Friendly - Curated list to ensure decent item pool when only playing adventure\nNone - removes all unique plants from the pool","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"on","label":"On","id":0},{"value":"exclude_overpowered","label":"Exclude Overpowered","id":1},{"value":"adventure_friendly","label":"Adventure Friendly","id":2},{"value":"none","label":"None","id":3}],"aliases":{"true":"on"},"default":"exclude_overpowered","doc_fr":"On - toutes les plantes uniques sont dans la piscine (ces plantes ont tendance à être très suralimentées donc utiliser à vos propres risques)\nExclure les plantes suralimentées - supprime les plantes uniques qui sont considérées comme suralimentées Adventure Friendly - Liste curée pour assurer une piscine d'articles décents quand seulement jouer à l'aventure Aucune - enlève toutes les plantes uniques de la piscine"},{"key":"unique_blacklist","name":"Unique Plant Blacklist","kind":"list","doc":"Blacklist for unique plants, keys are by almanac entry\nSet Unqiue plants to 'on' and blacklist specific ones here","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"default":[],"valid_keys":["Amp-nion","Burger Blaster","Cattail Girl","Chrysanctum","Coldsnap Bean","Diamond Imitater","Doubleblast Passionfruit","Icetip Lily","Lucky Blover","Nyan Squash","Pearmafrost","Queen Endoflame","Snipea","Swordmaster Starfruit"],"doc_fr":"Liste noire pour les plantes uniques, les clés sont par entrée almanac\nDéfinir des plantes Unqiue pour 'on' et liste noire spécifiques ici"},{"key":"no_start_plant","name":"Starting Plant Blacklist","kind":"list","doc":"Blacklist for starting plants\nvalid keys: {\"Peashooter\",\"Fume-shroom\",\"Scaredy-shroom\",\"Threepeater\",\"Cactus\",\"Starfruit\",\"Cabbage-pult\",\"Kernel-pult\",\"Spruce Sharpshooter\"}","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"default":[],"valid_keys":["Cabbage-pult","Cactus","Fume-shroom","Kernel-pult","Peashooter","Scaredy-shroom","Spruce Sharpshooter","Starfruit","Threepeater"],"doc_fr":"Liste noire pour les clés valides des plantes de départ: {\"Peashooter\", \"Fume-shroom\", \"Scaredy-shroom\", \"Threepeater\", \"Cactus\", \"Starfruit\", \"Cabbbage-pult\", \"Kernel-pult\", \"Spuce Sharpshooter\"}"}]},{"name":"Item & Location Options","collapsed":true,"options":[{"key":"local_items","name":"Local Items","kind":"set","doc":"Forces these items to be in their native world.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Forces these items to be in their native world.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","name_groups":true,"doc_fr":"Force ces objets à être dans leur monde d'origine.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Force ces objets à être dans leur monde d'origine.</p>\n"},{"key":"non_local_items","name":"Non-local Items","kind":"set","doc":"Forces these items to be outside their native world.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Forces these items to be outside their native world.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","name_groups":true,"doc_fr":"Force ces objets à être en dehors de leur monde d'origine.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Force ces objets à être en dehors de leur monde d'origine.</p>\n"},{"key":"start_inventory","name":"Start Inventory","kind":"counter","doc":"Start with the specified amount of these items. Example: {Bomb: 1, Arrow: 3} ","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Start with the specified amount of these items. Example: {Bomb: 1, Arrow: 3}</p>\n","default":{},"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","min":null,"max":10000,"doc_fr":"Commencez par le montant spécifié de ces éléments. Exemple : {Bomb : 1, Flèche : 3}","doc_html_fr":"<p>Commencez par le montant spécifié de ces éléments. Exemple : {Bomb : 1, Flèche : 3}</p>\n"},{"key":"start_hints","name":"Start Hints","kind":"set","doc":"Start with these item's locations prefilled into the ``!hint`` command.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Start with these item's locations prefilled into the <tt class=\"docutils literal\">!hint</tt> command.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","name_groups":true,"doc_fr":"Commencez par les emplacements de ces éléments préremplis dans la commande ``!hint``.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Commencez par les emplacements de ces éléments préremplis dans la commande <tt class=\"docutils literal\">!hint</tt>.</p>\n"},{"key":"start_location_hints","name":"Start Location Hints","kind":"set","doc":"Start with these locations and their item prefilled into the ``!hint`` command.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Start with these locations and their item 